### File Structure

```
OnlineThriftStore/
│
├── app.py
├── templates/
│   ├── login.html
│   ├── register.html
│   ├── dashboard.html
│   ├── item_details.html
│   ├── shopping_cart.html
│   ├── checkout.html
│   ├── sell_item.html
│   └── user_profile.html
│
├── static/
│   ├── css/
│   │   └── styles.css
│   └── js/
│       └── scripts.js
│
└── data/
    ├── users.txt
    ├── on_sale.txt
    ├── carts.txt
    └── sold.txt
```

### File Descriptions

- **app.py**: The main application file that contains the Flask backend code. It handles routing, user authentication, item management, and data storage/retrieval from text files.

- **templates/**: This directory contains all the HTML files for the web application. Each file corresponds to a specific page in the application.
  - **login.html**: The HTML template for the login page where users can enter their credentials.
  - **register.html**: The HTML template for the registration page where new users can create an account.
  - **dashboard.html**: The HTML template for the dashboard page where users can browse items, access their cart, and navigate to other sections.
  - **item_details.html**: The HTML template for displaying detailed information about a specific item.
  - **shopping_cart.html**: The HTML template for the shopping cart page where users can view and manage their selected items.
  - **checkout.html**: The HTML template for the checkout page where users can review their order and enter payment details.
  - **sell_item.html**: The HTML template for the page where users can list a new item for sale.
  - **user_profile.html**: The HTML template for the user profile page displaying the user's information and their purchased/selling items.

- **static/**: This directory contains static files such as CSS and JavaScript.
  - **css/**: Contains stylesheets for the application.
    - **styles.css**: The main CSS file for styling the web application.
  - **js/**: Contains JavaScript files for client-side functionality.
    - **scripts.js**: The main JavaScript file for handling user interactions and dynamic content.

- **data/**: This directory contains text files for data storage.
  - **users.txt**: Stores user credentials in the format `username:password`.
  - **on_sale.txt**: Stores items available for sale in the format `title|description|price|seller_username`.
  - **carts.txt**: Stores items in users' shopping carts in the format `username|item_title`.
  - **sold.txt**: Stores sold items history in the format `buyer_username|title|description|price|seller_username`.

